  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Find and create <a href=\"IndexDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>IndexDefinition</code></a>s for properties of given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>. <a href=\"IndexDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>IndexDefinition</code></a>s\nare created for properties and types with <a href=\"Indexed.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>Indexed</code></a>, <a href=\"CompoundIndexes.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>CompoundIndexes</code></a> or <a href=\"GeoSpatialIndexed.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>GeoSpatialIndexed</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为给定<a href=\"IndexDefinition.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index 中的接口\"><code>IndexDefinition</code></a>的属性查找并创建索引定义。对于带有<a href=\"Indexed.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index 中的注解接口\"><code>Indexed</code></a>、<a href=\"CompoundIndexes.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index 中的注解接口\"><code>CompoundIndexes</code></a>或<a href=\"GeoSpatialIndexed.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index 中的注解接口\"><code>GeoSpatialIndexed</code></a>的属性及类型，将创建相应的索引定义。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"IndexResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>IndexResolver</code></a> given <a href=\"../mapping/MongoMappingContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>MongoMappingContext</code></a>.",
      "translation": "根据给定的<a href=\"../mapping/MongoMappingContext.html\" title=\"类在 org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping 包中\"><code>MongoMappingContext</code></a>创建一个新的<a href=\"IndexResolver.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index 包中的接口\"><code>IndexResolver</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Find and create <a href=\"IndexDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>IndexDefinition</code></a>s for properties of given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为给定<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"类或接口在 org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>的属性创建<a href=\"IndexDefinition.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index 中的接口\"><code>IndexDefinition</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Empty <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a> in case no <a href=\"IndexDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>IndexDefinition</code></a> could be resolved for type.",
      "translation": "如果无法为类型解析出任何 <a href=\"IndexDefinition.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index 中的接口\"><code>IndexDefinition</code></a>，则返回空的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>Iterable</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The <a href=\"IndexResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>IndexResolver</code></a> considers index annotations like <a href=\"Indexed.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>Indexed</code></a>, <a href=\"GeoSpatialIndexed.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>GeoSpatialIndexed</code></a>,\n<a href=\"HashIndexed.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>HashIndexed</code></a>, <a href=\"TextIndexed.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>TextIndexed</code></a> and <a href=\"WildcardIndexed.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>WildcardIndexed</code></a> on properties as well as <a href=\"CompoundIndex.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>CompoundIndex</code></a>\nand <a href=\"WildcardIndexed.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>WildcardIndexed</code></a> on types.",
      "translation": "`<a href=\"IndexResolver.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index 中的接口\"><code>IndexResolver</code></a>` 会考虑属性上的索引注解，如 `<a href=\"Indexed.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index 中的注解接口\"><code>Indexed</code></a>`、`<a href=\"GeoSpatialIndexed.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index 中的注解接口\"><code>GeoSpatialIndexed</code></a>`、`<a href=\"HashIndexed.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index 中的注解接口\"><code>HashIndexed</code></a>`、`<a href=\"TextIndexed.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index 中的注解接口\"><code>TextIndexed</code></a>` 和 `<a href=\"WildcardIndexed.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index 中的注解接口\"><code>WildcardIndexed</code></a>`，以及类型上的 `<a href=\"CompoundIndex.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index 中的注解接口\"><code>CompoundIndex</code></a>` 和 `<a href=\"WildcardIndexed.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index 中的注解接口\"><code>WildcardIndexed</code></a>`。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Unless specified otherwise the index name will be created out of the keys/path involved in the index. <br/>\n<a href=\"TextIndexed.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>TextIndexed</code></a> properties are collected into a single index that covers the detected fields. <br/>\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> like structures, unless annotated with <a href=\"WildcardIndexed.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>WildcardIndexed</code></a>, are skipped because the\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.Entry.html#getKey()\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>map key</code></a>, which cannot be resolved from static metadata, needs to be part of the\nindex.",
      "translation": "除非另有说明，索引名称将由参与该索引的键/路径生成。<br/>\n<a href=\"TextIndexed.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index 中的注解接口\"><code>TextIndexed</code></a>属性会被收集到一个覆盖所有检测到的字段的单个索引中。<br/>\n除非使用 <a href=\"WildcardIndexed.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index 中的注解接口\"><code>WildcardIndexed</code></a>进行注解，否则类似<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>Map</code></a>的结构将被跳过，因为\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.Entry.html#getKey()\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>map key</code></a>无法从静态元数据中解析，因此需要包含在索引中。",
      "count": 1
    },
