    {
      "source": "<a href=\"IndexResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>IndexResolver</code></a> finds those <a href=\"IndexDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>IndexDefinition</code></a>s to be created for a given class.",
